# Build context for demo/Dockerfile.
#
# BuildKit prefers <dockerfile>.dockerignore over the context root's
# .dockerignore, so this file widens the context for the demo image only: it
# adds demo/, which the production image at the repository root must not ship.
# Same allowlist discipline — local state never enters the context.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE*
!NOTICE
!vecshield/
!vecshield_platform/
!demo/
!wheelhouse/

# The console is served from the hand-written dist/ bundle; the dashboard's
# tests and Node tooling are not part of the image.
vecshield_platform/api/dashboard/*
!vecshield_platform/api/dashboard/dist/

# A seeded estate from a previous local run must never be baked in: the image
# seeds its own at first boot.
demo/demo-state
demo/.demo

# Never ship dependencies, caches, build output or state from inside the
# allowed trees (these rules come last so they override the allowlist).
**/node_modules
**/.venv*
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info
**/build
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.DS_Store
**/demo-state
**/*.db*
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.jsonl
**/*.state
**/.env*
